# ============================================================
# RULECAST — NOVA TEST SUITE
#
# EXPECTED RESULTS (update when adding rules):
#   Total rules  : 7
#   Valid        : 5
#   Invalid      : 2
#   Incomplete   : 0
#
# Run with: python3 main.py test → choose nova → file
